<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Civic United Front</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1992</span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a> · Also known as CUF</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Civic United Front is a Tanzanian political party founded in 1992, strongest in Zanzibar and above all on Pemba. Its long rivalry with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chama-cha-mapinduzi">Chama Cha Mapinduzi</a> produced disputed elections on the islands in 1995, 2000 and 2005 and the killing of opposition protesters in January 2001. A government of national unity with CCM was formed in Zanzibar in 2010, and many of its members later joined ACT-Wazalendo.</p></div>
